OL,3,AUS sanctions more Cuban companies and
OL,4,Aofficials
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, Rubio accused various
OL,7,Ffigures of "ferrying a new brigade of
OL,8,Finternational sympathizers to Havana to
OL,9,Fnetwork with regime officials" to
OL,10,Fcoincide with the late former leader
OL,11,FFidel Castro's 100th birthday.
OL,13,FCuba has denounced all sanctions
OL,14,Fimposed by the Trump administration.
